        },
        {
          "en": 3,
          "texto": {
            "es": "\"NO COMO DIJO MOISÉS\"",
            "en": "\"NOT AS MOSES SAID\""
          },
          "x": 960,
          "y": 170
        }
      ],
      "frases": [
        {
          "en": "So he took out a part of the power that was in Adam.",
          "es": "Entonces sacó una parte del poder que había en Adán."
        },
        {
          "en": "And he shaped another figure, in the form of a woman.",
          "es": "Y formó otra figura, con forma de mujer."
        },
        {
          "en": "He made her like the Epinoia that had appeared to him.",
          "es": "La hizo parecida a la Epinoia que se le había aparecido."
        },
        {
          "en": "He put the power he had taken from the man into the woman.",
          "es": "Puso en la mujer el poder que le había sacado al hombre."
        },
        {
          "en": "The Savior said, \"It was not as Moses said, 'his rib bone.'\"",
          "es": "El Salvador dijo: \"No fue como dijo Moisés, 'su hueso de la costilla'\"."
        }
      ]
    },
