          "en": 0.5,
          "texto": {
            "es": "UNA SOLA CARNE",
            "en": "ONE FLESH"
          },
          "x": 960,
          "y": 200
        }
      ],
      "frases": [
        {
          "en": "\"So a man will leave his father and his mother, and hold on to his wife.\"",
          "es": "\"Por eso el hombre dejará a su padre y a su madre, y se unirá a su mujer\"."
        },
        {
          "en": "\"And the two of them will be one flesh.\"",
          "es": "\"Y los dos serán una sola carne\"."
        },
        {
          "en": "\"For his partner will be sent to him, and he will leave his father and his mother.\"",
          "es": "\"Porque le enviarán a su pareja, y él dejará a su padre y a su madre\"."
        }
      ]
    },
