          "x": 960,
          "y": 170,
          "hasta": 2
        },
        {
          "en": 2.1,
          "texto": {
            "es": "SU PENSAMIENTO DESPIERTA",
            "en": "THEIR THINKING AWAKENS"
          },
          "x": 960,
          "y": 170
        }
      ],
      "frases": [
        {
          "en": "\"I came as an eagle on the tree of knowledge, to teach them and to wake them.\"",
          "es": "\"Vine como águila sobre el árbol del conocimiento, para enseñarles y despertarlos\"."
        },
        {
          "en": "\"For both of them were fallen, and they knew that they were naked.\"",
          "es": "\"Porque los dos estaban caídos, y supieron que estaban desnudos\"."
        },
        {
          "en": "\"The Epinoia appeared to them as light, and she woke up their thinking.\"",
          "es": "\"La Epinoia se les apareció como luz, y despertó su pensamiento\"."
        }
      ]
