          "en": 0.3,
          "texto": {
            "es": "MALDIJO SU TIERRA",
            "en": "HE CURSED HIS EARTH"
          },
          "x": 960,
          "y": 180,
          "hasta": 2
        },
        {
          "en": 3.6,
          "texto": {
            "es": "ECHADOS DEL PARAÍSO",
            "en": "CAST OUT OF PARADISE"
          },
          "x": 960,
          "y": 180
        }
      ],
      "frases": [
        {
          "en": "\"Yaldabaoth saw that they had turned away from him, and he cursed his earth.\"",
          "es": "\"Yaldabaoth vio que se habían apartado de él, y maldijo su tierra\"."
        },
        {
          "en": "\"He found the woman as she was getting ready for her husband.\"",
          "es": "\"Encontró a la mujer mientras se preparaba para su marido\"."
        },
        {
          "en": "\"And he made himself lord over her, though he did not know the mystery of the holy plan.\"",
          "es": "\"Y se hizo señor sobre ella, aunque no conocía el misterio del plan santo\"."
        },
        {
          "en": "\"They were afraid to blame him. And he showed his angels the ignorance that is in him.\"",
          "es": "\"Ellos tuvieron miedo de reprocharle. Y él mostró a sus ángeles la ignorancia que hay en él\"."
        },
        {
          "en": "\"He threw them out of paradise, and he dressed them in gloomy darkness.\"",
          "es": "\"Los echó del paraíso, y los vistió de oscuridad sombría\"."
        }
      ]
    },
