      "frases": [
        {
          "en": "\"To this day, the union of the sexes goes on because of the first ruler.\"",
          "es": "\"Hasta el día de hoy, la unión de los sexos sigue por causa del primer gobernante\"."
        },
        {
          "en": "\"He planted the desire for begetting in the woman who belongs to Adam.\"",
          "es": "\"Él sembró el deseo de engendrar en la mujer que pertenece a Adán\"."
        },
        {
          "en": "\"Through that union he raised up copies of bodies.\"",
          "es": "\"Por medio de esa unión hizo surgir copias de cuerpos\"."
        },
        {
          "en": "\"And he breathed into them from his false spirit.\"",
          "es": "\"Y les sopló de su espíritu falso\"."
        },
        {
          "en": "\"He set the two rulers over the powers, so that they would rule over the tomb.\"",
          "es": "\"Puso a los dos gobernantes sobre los poderes, para que gobernaran sobre la tumba\"."
